{"name":"Topiary","hex":"#8e9655","fetched":"2026-10-13","looked":{"definitions":[{"term":"topiary","whole":true,"parts":[{"part":"Adjective","definitions":["Of, or relating to art of topiaries.","Of a tree or shrub, trimmed in artistic shape."]},{"part":"Noun","definitions":["Art or practice of trimming shrubs or trees in artistic or ornamental shapes, e.g. of animals.","A garden decorated with such art."]}],"link":"https://en.wiktionary.org/wiki/topiary"}],"entries":[{"title":"Topiary","blocks":[{"text":"Topiary is the horticultural practice of training perennial plants by clipping the foliage and twigs of trees, shrubs and subshrubs to develop and maintain clearly defined shapes, whether geometric or fanciful. The term also refers to plants which have been shaped in this way. As an art form it is a type of living sculpture. The word derives from the Latin word for an ornamental landscape gardener, topiarius, a creator of topia or \"places\", a Greek word that Romans also applied to fictive indoor landscapes executed in fresco."}],"image":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/e/ec/Cementerio%2C_Tulc%C3%A1n%2C_Ecuador%2C_2015-07-21%2C_DD_60.JPG/330px-Cementerio%2C_Tulc%C3%A1n%2C_Ecuador%2C_2015-07-21%2C_DD_60.JPG?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=api&utm_content=thumbnail","link":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Topiary"},{"title":"Topiary (hacktivist)","blocks":[{"text":"Jake Leslie Davis, known professionally as Topiary, is a British hacktivist. He has worked with Anonymous, LulzSec, and other similar groups. He was an associate of the Internet group Anonymous, which has publicly claimed various online attacks, including hacking HBGary, Westboro Baptist Church, and Gawker. They have also claimed responsibility for the defacing of government websites in countries such as Zimbabwe, Syria, Tunisia, Ireland, and Egypt."}],"link":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Topiary_(hacktivist)"}],"images":[{"srcset":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/6/6b/Pt-ctb-jardimpaco.jpg/250px-Pt-ctb-jardimpaco.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=parser&utm_content=thumbnail 1x, https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/6/6b/Pt-ctb-jardimpaco.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=parser&utm_content=thumbnail_unscaled 2x","src":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/6/6b/Pt-ctb-jardimpaco.jpg/250px-Pt-ctb-jardimpaco.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=parser&utm_content=thumbnail","alt":"Castelo Branco Portugal","link":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/File%3APt-ctb-jardimpaco.jpg"},{"srcset":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/5/53/Korea-Geoje-Oedo_4098-06.JPG/500px-Korea-Geoje-Oedo_4098-06.JPG?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=parser&utm_content=thumbnail 1x","src":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/5/53/Korea-Geoje-Oedo_4098-06.JPG/500px-Korea-Geoje-Oedo_4098-06.JPG?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=parser&utm_content=thumbnail","alt":"Cloud-pruning only distantly related to natural forms in Hallyeo Haesang National Park, Geoje, South Korea","link":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/File%3AKorea-Geoje-Oedo_4098-06.JPG"},{"srcset":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/3/35/Hortus_Palatinus_und_Heidelberger_Schloss_von_Jacques_Fouquiere.jpg/500px-Hortus_Palatinus_und_Heidelberger_Schloss_von_Jacques_Fouquiere.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=parser&utm_content=thumbnail 1x, https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/3/35/Hortus_Palatinus_und_Heidelberger_Schloss_von_Jacques_Fouquiere.jpg/1280px-Hortus_Palatinus_und_Heidelberger_Schloss_von_Jacques_Fouquiere.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=parser&utm_content=thumbnail 2x","src":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/3/35/Hortus_Palatinus_und_Heidelberger_Schloss_von_Jacques_Fouquiere.jpg/500px-Hortus_Palatinus_und_Heidelberger_Schloss_von_Jacques_Fouquiere.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=parser&utm_content=